        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl ni Yɛ-ɣo-a-ɣadh",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ run ruëc Yo-ac gat Ä-ɣɛ̈dh-yaa kuäär Juda ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ diɔ̱k, cu Yɛ-ɣo-a-ɣadh gat Yeɣu a kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl kä Tha-mɛ-ria, kä cuɛ ruëc kɛ run wäl bärɔw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ la̱t ni jiäk waaŋ Kuɔth Nhial, cuɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r ni dueer Ya-rɔ-baam gat Nɛ-bat mëë jak I-thɛ-rɛl kä dui̱r. /Kenɛ kɛ päl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuɔth Nhial kɛ̈c kɛ I-thɛ-rɛl, kä cuɛ kɛ la̱th tetdä kua̱r Thi-ri-ya ni Ɣä-dha-el kɛnɛ tet Bɛn-a-dad gat Ɣä-dha-el. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yɛ-ɣo-a-ɣadh Kuoth Nhial pal, kä cu Kuoth jɛ liŋ. Kɛ ɣöö cɛ riɛk I-thɛ-rɛl nɛn, min ca lät kä kɛ ɛ kuäär Thi-ri-ya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ cu Kuoth Nhial I-thɛ-rɛl moc kɛ kään, kä cukɛ rɔ bar tetni ji̱ Thi-ri-ya. Kä cukɛ cieŋ dho̱rikiɛn ce̱tkɛ ta̱a̱ ëë wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /kenkɛ duer dhɔaar Ya-rɔ-baam päl, mëë ci I-thɛ-rɛl jak kä dui̱r, kä cukɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r nikɛ. Kä cu puɔ̱ny Ac-tar-te ŋot cuŋä kä Tha-mɛ-ria bä.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ thil rɛm mi di̱i̱t mi cu duɔth kä rɛm Yɛ-ɣo-a-ɣadh, cu duɔth ni jio̱ŋko̱o̱ri ti jiɛn dhieec, kɛ thurbiɛɛli da̱ŋ wäl, kɛ rɛm mi̱ bathdɔɔri wäl. Kɛ ɣöö ci kuäär Thi-ri-ya duɔthkiɛn nor ce̱tnikɛ tup döör. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua duɔth lätni Yɛ-ɣo-a-ɣadh gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk kuɛ̈ɛ̈ni kua̱ri I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ li̱w, kä cua jɛ kony kä Tha-mɛ-ria. Kä cu gatdɛ ni Yo-ac ruec kɛ gua̱a̱thdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl ni Yɛ-ɣo-ac",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ run ruec Yo-ac kuäär Juda ti jiɛn diɔ̱k wi̱cdɛ bärɔw, cu Yɛ-ɣo-ac gat Yɛ-ɣo-a-ɣadh a kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl kä Tha-mɛ-ria, kä cuɛ ruec kɛ run bäkɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ la̱t ni jiäk bä waaŋ Kuɔth Nhial. /Kenɛ dueer Ya-rɔ-baam gat Nɛ-bat päl, tëë cɛ I-thɛ-rɛl jak kä dui̱r, cuɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r nikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua duɔth lätni Yɛ-ɣo-ac gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk kuɛ̈ɛ̈ni kua̱ri I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yɛ-ɣo-ac li̱w, kä cu Ya-rɔ-baam kuäärɛ ka̱n. Kä cua Yɛ-ɣo-ac kony kɛɛl kɛ kua̱r I-thɛ-rɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruac Ɛ-li-cä in Jɔak kɛnɛ lia̱a̱dɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Ɛ-li-cä tekɛ juey mi bi jɛ näk, cu Yɛ-ɣo-ac kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl wä kä jɛ. Kä cuɛ wä nhiamdɛ i̱, “Gua̱di̱n! Bum ni ji̱n kä thurbiɛɛli I-thɛ-rɛl kɛnɛ jio̱ŋko̱o̱rikɛ!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɛ-li-cä jɛ jiök i̱, “Käni bäär kɛnɛ dɔwdɛ.” Kä cuɛ kɛ ka̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɛ-li-cä jɛ jiök i̱, “Läth ni dɔwdɛ thi̱n.” Kä cuɛ dɔwdɛ la̱th thi̱n. Kä cu Ɛ-li-cä tetdɛ la̱th jɔk tetni kua̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kuäär jiök i̱, “Lɛp wernyin kuec känyä ca̱ŋ.” Kä cuɛ jɛ lɛp. Kä cu Ɛ-li-cä wee, “Yori jɛ.” Kä cuɛ jɛ yuɔr. Kä cu Ɛ-li-cä wee, “Ɛ bäär jucä Kuɔth Nhial, ɛ bäär jucä Thi-ri-ya! Kɛ ɣöö bi nyiëëny kɛ Thi-ri-ya kä Ä-pek amäni mi cikɛ Thum.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kuäär jiök i̱, “Käni bääri.” Kä cuɛ kɛ ka̱n. Kä cuɛ kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl jiök i̱, “Duäc piny kɛ kɛ.” Cuɛ piny duäc kä diɔ̱ɔ̱k kä cuɛ cu päl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu raan Kuɔth gaak kɛ jɛ, wee i̱, “Deri jɛ duäc nikä dhieec kiɛ kä bäkɛl. Kɛ ɣöö deri Thi-ri-ya däk amäni mi ciɛ thum, kä täämɛ biɛ däk kä diɔ̱ɔ̱k kärɔ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɛ-li-cä li̱w, kä cukɛ jɛ kony. Kä täämɛ tëë kɛ buɔ̱n ji̱ Mo-ab la mun ben a mackɛ kɛ ruel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ cäŋ kɛl tëë kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ti kuɔnykɛ raan, cu buɔ̱n kɛ pärikä kä cua raan yuɔr kɔ̱k Ɛ-li-cä. Kä niɛ min cɛ cɔ̱w Ɛ-li-cä nyɔt, cuɛ tëk a bɛ cuɔ̱ŋ nikɛ ciökɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ko̱r kam I-thɛ-rɛl kɛnɛ Thi-ri-ya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ cu Ɣä-dha-el kuäär Thi-ri-ya I-thɛ-rɛl ciɛŋ a jiäk kɛ ni̱n Yɛ-ɣo-a-ɣadh diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö te Kuoth Nhial kɛ nhök kɛnɛ pälikä kɛ kɛ, kä cuɛ kɛ luäk kɛ kui̱ matdä ruacdɛ kɛnɛ A-bɛ-ram kɛ Ay-dhɛk kɛ Je-kɔb, amäni walɛ /cɛ dëë nhɔk ɛn ɣöö bɛ kɛ däk kiɛ bɛ kɛ tuk nhiamdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
